# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows
# included. Git for Windows converts LF to CRLF on checkout by default
# (core.autocrlf), and the spec corpus, the boru sources and the golden
# outputs are compared byte for byte: a CRLF checkout fails spec rows on a
# trailing carriage return (`want "Integer\r"`). Binary files are detected
# and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Encrypted golden fixtures: the bytes are the contract (cmd/go/internal/wire).
# Never let a checkout convert line endings or diff them as text.
cmd/go/internal/wire/testdata/*.golden binary
